OL,3,GNEWSAMurder detectives seeking 'vital'
OL,4,Adashcam footage
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives working on a murder
OL,7,Finvestigation have appealed for dashcam
OL,8,Ffootage, saying it is "vital" the
OL,9,Fpublic contact them even if there
OL,10,Fappears to be "nothing important on the
OL,11,Frecording".
OL,13,FGraham Pennycook, 64, was found dead in
OL,14,Fwoodland next to Perham Down polo
OL,15,Ffield, Wiltshire.
OL,17,FHis death was treated as suspicious
OL,18,Fafter a post mortem examination and a
OL,19,Fmurder investigation is ongoing.
